{"id":"6d85c656be153752","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum.md","title":"A Countermodel to the Printed Fourth Table Entry","display":"ex-fixed-point-table-erratum — A Countermodel to the Printed Fourth Table Entry","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum","aliases":["89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"ex-fixed-point-table-erratum — A Countermodel to the Printed Fourth Table Entry","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","[[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-fixed-point-table-erratum — A Countermodel to the Printed Fourth Table Entry"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"426d9ae12ef39fe8\" href=\"?note=426d9ae12ef39fe8\" title=\"89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence\">89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_4=\\neg\\Box\\neg p\">\\(A_4=\\neg\\Box\\neg p\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{print}}=\\neg\\Box\\bot\">\\(H_{\\mathrm{print}}=\\neg\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 是所给 PDF 第 105 页表第 4 行的右项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为弱与原书不动点谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(\\{0,1\\},\\{(1,0)\\},V)\">\\(M=(\\{0,1\\},\\{(1,0)\\},V)\\)</span> 为任意字母赋值下的二点 GL 模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}table\\text{-}erratum}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M,1\\models H_{\\mathrm{print}}\\land\\neg A_4[p:=H_{\\mathrm{print}}],\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_4,p,H_{\\mathrm{print}}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_4,p,\\bot).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}table\\text{-}erratum}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M,1\\models H_{\\mathrm{print}}\\land\\neg A_4[p:=H_{\\mathrm{print}}],\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_4,p,H_{\\mathrm{print}}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_4,p,\\bot).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 105（表第 4 行）、107；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>本条针对用户提供 PDF 的可见表格，不据此声称其他版本同样印错。放大渲染显示第 4 行左项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\neg p\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\neg p\\)</span>，右项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\bot\\)</span>。在二点链根 1，右项真；死端 0 的右项假，因而根满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\neg H_{\\mathrm{print}}\">\\(\\Box\\neg H_{\\mathrm{print}}\\)</span>，左项回代为假。这是真正 GL 框架中的明确反模型，可靠性排除该弱候选。\n正确候选为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>：回代左项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\neg\\bot\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\neg\\bot\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\top\">\\(\\Box\\top\\)</span> 是 GL 定理，故它等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>；模态化条件下的弱/加强等价给 BookFix。原书第 107 页说 line 4 描述 refutable sentences，也支持这一修正。\n证据图保存在本轮 source-images/p105-table.png。原书文本和图像都有保留；这里同时记录印刷证据与数学纠正，不为迎合表格牺牲公式正确性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A_4=\\neg\\Box\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\mathrm{print}}=\\neg\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(\\{0,1\\},\\{(1,0)\\},V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}table\\text{-}erratum}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&M,1\\models H_{\\mathrm{print}}\\land\\neg A_4[p:=H_{\\mathrm{print}}],\\\\\n&\\neg\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_4,p,H_{\\mathrm{print}}),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_4,p,\\bot).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\neg H_{\\mathrm{print}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box\\neg\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":2133,"backlinks":[{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"印刷表格勘误见 [[89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum]]：原包所述印刷页 105 表第 4 行的右项有二点 GL 反模型，正确候选为底。符号和证明的前轮总账见 `_revision-2026-10-05-further/report`（历史报告未提供）。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"例子与边界：[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase]]、[[89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum]]、[[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]、[[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。练习展开：[[89-lem-fixed-point-valuation]]、[[89-thm-double-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["85e306b51d3267ec","9f00301866fbd6f0","0157f8bea9275cf1","426d9ae12ef39fe8","0006800fa1c85177"]}